// Fictional syntax fixture, not a prescription or an RxNorm formulary entry.
// Patient keeps age before condition; keyword-looking names retain their spelling.
Patient Po: age 45, condition Dose

// Reordered fields, mixed case, adjacent dose/unit, quoted product qualifiers.
mEdIcAtIoN DemoLiquid: frequency bId, doseForm "Oral Solution", strength "160MG/5ML", route pO, dose 10MG

// Plan references are case-insensitive; JSON retains declaration spelling.
pLaN DemoPlan: prescribe demoliQuid, for po
SHOW demoplan

// Try ? with the cursor after dose 10MG or before an existing field.
// Comments never count as fields. Use Ctrl+Space to edit a value or add a field.
